@SprintFlowAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Get all projects
GET {{SprintFlowAPI_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Create a new project
POST {{SprintFlowAPI_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "SprintFlow Core Platform",
  "description": "Next-generation agile sprint planning and tracking platform with PostgreSQL BIGINT backend."
}

###

### 3. Get project by ID (replace with created project numeric ID)
@projectId = 1
GET {{SprintFlowAPI_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Update an existing project
PUT {{SprintFlowAPI_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "SprintFlow Core Platform (Updated)",
  "description": "Updated project description with real-time kanban boards and story estimation."
}

###

### 5. Delete a project
DELETE {{SprintFlowAPI_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}

###
